<%- include('partials/app-start') %>

<main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-5 sm:px-6 sm:py-8">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4">
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">Furos do dia</p>
      <h1 class="mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Piloto automático</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
        Roda no servidor: pode fechar o navegador ou desligar o computador que ele continua procurando pautas,
        escrevendo, gerando a imagem e agendando (cada matéria fica "Agendado" em Matérias salvas e sai sozinha na hora marcada). Use esta página para acompanhar, pausar ou retomar.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a href="/materia-manual?furos=1" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-emerald-300">Configurar no Furos do dia</a>
  </div>

  <section id="piloto-estado" class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-5">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span id="piloto-luz" class="inline-block h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-slate-500"></span>
        <div>
          <p id="piloto-titulo" class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Carregando…</p>
          <p id="piloto-sub" class="text-sm text-slate-400"></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <button type="button" id="piloto-pausar" hidden class="rounded-lg border border-amber-500/60 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-300 hover:bg-amber-500/10">Pausar</button>
        <button type="button" id="piloto-retomar" hidden class="rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 hover:bg-emerald-400">Retomar</button>
        <button type="button" id="piloto-cancelar-fila" hidden class="rounded-lg border border-rose-500/50 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-rose-300 hover:bg-rose-500/10">Cancelar fila escolhida</button>
        <button type="button" id="piloto-varrer" hidden class="rounded-lg border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-emerald-300">Varrer agora</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p id="piloto-aviso" class="mt-3 hidden rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-sm"></p>
    <p id="piloto-varredura" class="mt-3 hidden text-sm text-slate-300"></p>

    <dl class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-5">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60 p-3"><dt class="text-xs text-slate-400">Na fila</dt><dd id="piloto-n-fila" class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-white">–</dd></div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60 p-3"><dt class="text-xs text-slate-400">Escrevendo</dt><dd id="piloto-n-escrevendo" class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-white">–</dd></div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60 p-3"><dt class="text-xs text-slate-400">Imagem com IA</dt><dd id="piloto-n-imagem" class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-white">–</dd></div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60 p-3"><dt class="text-xs text-slate-400">Agendadas</dt><dd id="piloto-n-prontas" class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-white">–</dd></div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60 p-3"><dt class="text-xs text-slate-400">Publicadas hoje</dt><dd id="piloto-n-hoje" class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold text-white">–</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <details id="ntfy" class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-5">
    <summary class="flex cursor-pointer flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Notificações no celular (ntfy)</span>
      <span id="ntfy-estado" class="rounded-full bg-slate-500/20 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300">Desligadas</span>
    </summary>
    <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm text-slate-400">
      <li>Instale o app <strong class="text-slate-200">ntfy</strong> no celular (Play Store ou App Store).</li>
      <li>No app, toque em <strong class="text-slate-200">+</strong> e assine o tópico abaixo (mesmo nome, igualzinho).</li>
      <li>Clique em <strong class="text-slate-200">Salvar</strong> e depois em <strong class="text-slate-200">Enviar teste</strong>.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500">No ntfy.sh quem souber o nome do tópico consegue ler os avisos: use o nome gerado, difícil de adivinhar.</p>

    <form id="ntfy-form" class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2" autocomplete="off">
      <label class="block sm:col-span-2">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">Tópico</span>
        <div class="mt-1 flex gap-2">
          <input id="ntfy-topico" maxlength="64" spellcheck="false" placeholder="ex.: viralizeai-k3p9x2m7qa" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950/60 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-slate-500 focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none" />
          <button type="button" id="ntfy-gerar" class="shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 px-3 text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-emerald-300">Gerar</button>
          <button type="button" id="ntfy-copiar" class="shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 px-3 text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-emerald-300">Copiar</button>
        </div>
      </label>
      <label class="block">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">Servidor <span class="font-normal text-slate-500">(opcional)</span></span>
        <input id="ntfy-servidor" type="url" maxlength="255" placeholder="https://ntfy.sh" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950/60 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-slate-500 focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none" />
      </label>
      <label class="block">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">Token de acesso <span class="font-normal text-slate-500">(só para tópico protegido)</span></span>
        <input id="ntfy-token" type="password" maxlength="255" placeholder="tk_…" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950/60 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-slate-500 focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none" />
      </label>
      <fieldset class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 sm:col-span-2">
        <legend class="sr-only">Quando avisar</legend>
        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><input id="ntfy-publicada" type="checkbox" class="h-4 w-4 accent-emerald-500" checked /> Matéria publicada</label>
        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><input id="ntfy-falha" type="checkbox" class="h-4 w-4 accent-emerald-500" checked /> Matéria não publicada (com o motivo)</label>
      </fieldset>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 sm:col-span-2">
        <button type="submit" id="ntfy-salvar" class="rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 hover:bg-emerald-400">Salvar</button>
        <button type="button" id="ntfy-testar" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-700 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-emerald-300">Enviar teste</button>
        <p id="ntfy-msg" class="text-sm text-slate-400" role="status"></p>
      </div>
    </form>
  </details>

  <section class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-5">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Andamento</h2>
      <span id="piloto-atualizado" class="text-xs text-slate-500"></span>
    </div>
    <ol id="piloto-itens" class="mt-4 space-y-2"></ol>
    <p id="piloto-vazio" class="mt-4 hidden text-sm text-slate-500">Nenhuma pauta ainda. Com o piloto ligado, a primeira varredura acontece em instantes.</p>
  </section>

  <details id="piloto-fora" class="mt-6 hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-5">
    <summary class="cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-white">Ficaram de fora nas últimas 24h <span id="piloto-fora-n" class="text-sm font-normal text-slate-400"></span></summary>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500">Pautas que a IA não recomendou, repetidas ou retiradas. “Publicar mesmo assim” coloca a pauta na fila.</p>
    <ol id="piloto-fora-itens" class="mt-4 space-y-2"></ol>
  </details>
</main>

<script src="/js/piloto-automatico.js?v=20260930ntfy1"></script>
<%- include('partials/app-end') %>
